5033       options nosyntaxcheck obs=max firstobs=1 nodate nonumber nocenter linesize=160 pagesize=max nostimer nofullstimer validvarname=v7
5033     ! validmemname=compatible locale=en_US;
5034       %let syscc=0;
5035       title; footnote;
5036       ods _all_ close;
5037       ods listing gpath="%sysfunc(pathname(work))";
5038       ods graphics off;
5039       proc datasets library=work kill nolist;
NOTE: Deleting WORK.PR (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR).
NOTE: File WORK.REGSTRY (memtype=ITEMSTOR) cannot be deleted because it is in use.
NOTE: Deleting WORK.SASGOPT (memtype=CATALOG).
